{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 6947U  Oxford Nanopore Technologies plc  14 September 2026   14 September 2026Oxford Nanopore Technologies plc (the \"Company\")Share Incentive Plan (\"SIP\") PDMR NotificationNotification and public disclosure of transactions by persons discharging managerial responsibilities and persons…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 6947U  Oxford Nanopore Technologies plc  14 September 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["14 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["Oxford Nanopore Technologies plc (the \"Company\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Share Incentive Plan (\"SIP\") PDMR Notification"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notification and public disclosure of transactions by persons discharging managerial responsibilities and persons closely associated with them"]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company has been notified by Computershare Trustees Limited, the trustee of the SIP (the \"SIP Trustee\") that on 14 September 2026, it made an award of Partnership Shares (as defined in the SIP) of 96 Ordinary shares of £0.0001 each (\"Ordinary Shares\") on behalf of Francis Van Parys, a director of the Company and a Person Discharging Managerial Responsibilities (\"PDMR\") and 96 Ordinary Shares on behalf of Nick Keher, a director of the Company and a PDMR. The Ordinary Shares were purchased using each participating employee's gross salary at a price of £1.57 per Ordinary Share."]},{"type":"p","children":["Under the SIP, the SIP Trustee will award each participating employee one Matching Share (as defined in the SIP) for each Ordinary Share purchased by the employee under the SIP. On 14 September 2026, the Company issued 96 Ordinary Shares to the SIP Trustee to hold on behalf of Francis Van Parys to satisfy the Matching Shares awarded under the SIP to him on that date, and 96 Ordinary Shares to the SIP Trustee to hold on behalf of Nick Keher to satisfy the Matching Shares awarded under the SIP to him on that date."]},{"type":"p","c